# Arcade AI Lab needs no secrets: it is a static site with no backend and no API keys.
# Copy this file to `.env` only to change build options. Never commit `.env`.

# Base URL the production build is served from. The default (`./`) works at any path,
# e.g. https://<user>.github.io/ and https://<user>.github.io/<repo>/.
# Set an absolute path if you prefer absolute asset URLs.
# BASE_PATH=/Games/
